{
  "$comment": "dsh-theme-orbital palette — DeepSeek Blue (深潜) design. The only place colour values live. `alias` maps ui-theme's --dsw-alias-* tokens to a { light, dark } pair (ui-layout writes those inline on <body>, so the injected stylesheet declares them !important). `specific` maps the design platform's per-theme surfaces; `metrics` holds scheme-independent geometry. This release renders the DARK projection only (the host emits it under both scheme selectors and the browser half locks it inline); the light pairs are kept for the palette contract and a possible light projection later. `inherit` lists tokens this theme deliberately leaves to DSH, and `ignore` records a minifier artefact from the 0.2.1-rc.5 token dump. Single hue (brand #4D6BFE), separated by lightness only; hairlines are the brand colour at low alpha. The one sanctioned multi-hue exception is the composer light band (`--orbital-band-*`): a cyan→azure→violet strip that only ever paints on the input card's outer edge and its spill.",
  "version": 2,
